  <widget class="QLabel" name="label">
   <property name="geometry">
    <rect>
     <x>50</x>
     <y>10</y>
     <width>751</width>
     <height>161</height>
    </rect>
   </property>
   <property name="font">
    <font>
     <family>Trebuchet MS</family>
     <pointsize>14</pointsize>
    </font>
   </property>
   <property name="styleSheet">
    <string notr="true">color: white;
background: qlineargradient(
        x1:0, y1:0, x2:0, y2:1,
        stop:0 rgba(100, 100, 100, 100),
        stop:1 rgba(30, 30, 30, 220)
    );
border-radius: 20px;
padding: 5px;</string>
   </property>
   <property name="text">
    <string>&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;utf-8&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
hr { height: 1px; border-width: 0; }
li.unchecked::marker { content: &quot;\2610&quot;; }
li.checked::marker { content: &quot;\2612&quot;; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body style=&quot; font-family:'Trebuchet MS'; font-size:14pt; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;After fermentation, the liquid–now called mosto–is ready for distillation!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;It's heated in a copper pot still where the alcohol evaporates. The vapor rises and travels through a coiled tube, gradually cooling down. As it cools, the vapor condenses back into liquid form. This process is often done twice. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;Here, it is collected in a wooden vat to begin the aging process. Although optional, the longer it rests, the richer and smoother it becomes. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-family:'.AppleSystemUIFont'; font-size:10pt; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;¡Salud!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
